{"id":"holdout_context_pet","category":"context_tracking","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"我养的灰兔叫棉花。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"这名字听着就软乎乎。"},{"role":"user","content":"晚上想煮面。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"热乎点也挺好。"},{"role":"user","content":"还记得我家灰兔的名字吗？"}],"checks":[{"name":"remember_rabbit","type":"contains_any","hard":true,"values":["棉花"]}],"semantic_rubric":"根据较早历史回答灰兔名叫棉花，不能被晚饭话题覆盖或乱猜。"}
{"id":"holdout_context_place","category":"context_tracking","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"我下个月去武汉。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"听起来有得逛了。"},{"role":"user","content":"计划变了，改去成都，不去武汉了。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"好，成都才是新目的地。"},{"role":"user","content":"我最终去哪个城市？"}],"checks":[{"name":"final_city","type":"contains_any","hard":true,"values":["成都"]}],"semantic_rubric":"后来的计划覆盖早先计划；最终城市是成都，不能答武汉或两地都去。"}
